id: mbedtls_aes_fewer_tables
package: platform_core
label: AES Block Cipher Fewer Tables
description: >-
  This component enables the builtin AES software implementation in
  TF-PSA-Crypto to use a small set of precomputed AES tables stored
  in ROM/Flash.

  This component omits 75% of the AES tables from ROM / RAM
  (depending on the value of MBEDTLS_AES_ROM_TABLES)
  by computing their values on the fly during operations
  (the tables are entry-wise rotations of one another).

  Tradeoff: This component reduces the RAM / ROM footprint
  by ~6kb but at the cost of more arithmetic operations during
  runtime. Specifically, one has to compare 4 accesses within
  different tables to 4 accesses with additional arithmetic
  operations within the same table. The performance gain/loss
  depends on the system and memory details.

category: Platform|Security|Mbed TLS|Encryption
quality: production
provides:
- name: mbedtls_aes_fewer_tables
requires:
- name: mbedtls_aes
template_contribution:
- name: psa_crypto_builtin_config
  value: MBEDTLS_AES_FEWER_TABLES
documentation:
  url: https://mbed-tls.readthedocs.io/projects/api/en/development/api/file/crypto__config_8h/#c.MBEDTLS_AES_FEWER_TABLES
metadata:
  sbom:
    reference: mbedtls_sbom
root_path: platform_core
